{
  "name": "HL · Backup workflows → GitHub",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Backup workflows → GitHub (Lesson 3.8)\nNightly at 02:00: list every workflow through the n8n API and commit each one as workflows/<name>.json to a private GitHub repo (edit if it exists, create if it's new).\n\nThis template uses **HTTP Request** for the n8n API and GitHub, in place of the lesson's n8n and GitHub nodes. Same steps: Get many workflows → Code → Edit a file, with the error output → Create a file.\n\n**Credentials (Header Auth):**\n- \"n8n API\": Name X-N8N-API-KEY, Value = key from Settings → n8n API. Select in Get many workflows.\n- \"GitHub backup\": Name Authorization, Value = Bearer + a fine-grained token limited to harvestlane-n8n (Contents: read and write). Select in the three GitHub nodes.\n\n**Placeholders:** YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN (e.g. n8n.harvestlane.example), YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER.\n\nConnect Settings → Error workflow to HL · Error alerts. Keep the repo private.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "0b9ea4e1-e23a-40a4-a99e-17218de87d77",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -468
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Before this: the server (Lesson 3.8)\nUbuntu LTS, 2 GB RAM, SSH key, provider backups on. DNS A record n8n → server IP.\n```\nsudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y\ncurl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sudo sh\nsudo ufw allow OpenSSH && sudo ufw allow 80 && sudo ufw allow 443 && sudo ufw enable\nmkdir ~/n8n && cd ~/n8n\n```\nCreate .env, docker-compose.yml and Caddyfile (Card 3: pinned version, generated key, N8N_WEBHOOK_URL=https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/ and N8N_PROXY_HOPS=1, no 5678 port mapping). Save the key in your password manager. Then:\n```\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose logs -f n8n\n```\nOwner account + two-factor login. Import workflows, recreate credentials, publish, switch off the laptop copies. UptimeRobot on https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/healthz every 5 min.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "69baec2a-b67d-47a2-9a31-2ed356c66cf1",
      "name": "Server setup (from the lesson)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
