    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Edit, or create if new\nGitHub needs the file's current sha to edit it. GitHub · Get file reads it; Settings → On Error: **Continue (using error output)**. A 404 (workflow new since last night) goes out of the red error output to GitHub · Create a file.\n\nCode (Run Once for Each Item) builds the path workflows/<name>.json and the content, plus content_b64 because GitHub's API wants base64.\n\nThe n8n API returns up to 250 workflows per call; if you have more, add pagination on nextCursor.\n\nWorkflow JSON holds credential names and IDs, not secrets. Never commit the .env.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "85233e51-08ba-40ba-964d-1b25e018a201",
      "name": "Edit or create",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        180
      ]
    }
